<title>UK: Argentine Repackaged Bonds adds 50 mln Dem to bond.</title>
<headline>Argentine Repackaged Bonds adds 50 mln Dem to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINE REPACKAGED BONDS</p>
<p> AMT    *150 MLN DEM  COUPON    **10.50    MATURITY ***31.MAR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.125   PAY DATE  L-09.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.0	 REOFFER    100.125   AVE LIFE    4.75 YRS</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.50	LISTING     0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 100 MLN DEM LAUNCHED 29.JUL.96</p>
<p>	     **TO 30.SEP.99 THEN STEPS UP TO 13.75 PCT</p>
<p>	    ***CALLABLE AT PAR FROM 30.SEP.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
